# =============================================================================
# Links Golf — Vite / client (optional)
# Copy to `.env` / `.env.local` and adjust. See `references/deploy-smoke.md`.
# =============================================================================

# Production canonical origin (https only in prod). When set, `vite build` injects:
#   <link rel="canonical" …>, <meta property="og:url" …>,
#   and absolute og:image / twitter:image URLs for /og-share.png
# Leave unset on Manus previews so canonical does not point at the wrong host.
# VITE_PUBLIC_SITE_ORIGIN=https://linksgolfpr.com

# Optional Spanish strings for crawlers (JSON-LD WebSite alternateName + abstract).
# Does not duplicate og:description; pair with VITE_PUBLIC_SITE_ORIGIN for best results.
# VITE_OG_TITLE_ES=Membresía Links Golf
# VITE_OG_DESCRIPTION_ES=Una membresía. 15 campos asociados en Puerto Rico. Hasta 25% de descuento en green fees. Pase digital. $199/año.

# Unsplash (optional): live-fetch photos for the digital member card background from
# https://unsplash.com/collections/bJnL-rJ3zAM/golf — create an app + Access Key at https://unsplash.com/oauth/applications
# When unset, the app uses the same collection’s public image URLs (static list, no key).
# VITE_UNSPLASH_ACCESS_KEY=

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Google Maps (home “Our Network” map) — use ONE of the following:
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# Option A — Local / your own Google Cloud project (recommended for `pnpm dev`)
# 1. Google Cloud Console → APIs & Services → Enable “Maps JavaScript API”.
# 2. Credentials → Create API key → Application restrictions: HTTP referrers
#    → add `http://localhost:5173/*` (and your production origins when you deploy).
# 3. Ensure billing is enabled on the project (Google requires it for Maps).
# 4. Paste the key here and restart Vite:
#
# VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_browser_key_here
#
# Option B — Forge proxy (template / hosted builds that supply a Forge key)
# VITE_FRONTEND_FORGE_API_KEY=
# Optional override when not using the default host:
# VITE_FRONTEND_FORGE_API_URL=https://forge.butterfly-effect.dev
